# Project map

Полная карта: `docs/Meta/Structure.md`. Narrative: `docs/Home.md`.

## Корень

`compose.yaml`, `sail.cmd`, `.env.example` — Sail (PHP 8.4, pgvector, Redis, Mailpit, Ollama). Artisan: `docker compose exec laravel.test php artisan …`

## HTTP

Только `routes/api.php` + `bootstrap/app.php` (alias middleware `storyteller`). Без `web.php`, Blade, Inertia.

## Backend (`app/`)

| Путь | Назначение |
|------|------------|
| `Http/Controllers/` | Chat, Copilot, RagSearch, Auth |
| `Http/Middleware/EnsureStoryteller.php` | ST-only routes |
| `Rag/` | RagIndexer, RagSearcher, EmbeddingProvider |
| `Llm/` | OllamaChatProvider, NpcCopilotService |
| `Context/` | ContextBuilder, SummaryManager, TokenEstimator, L0/L1, storyteller intent |
| `Retrieval/` | scoped tools: search_messages, get_message_range, search_summaries |
| `Jobs/` | RAG, L0/final, storyteller intent |
| `Enums/RagSourceType.php` | message, summary, lore (+ npc, relationship — задел) |

Конфиг: `config/rag.php`, `config/ollama.php`, `config/copilot.php`.

## Frontend (`frontend/`)

`src/views/`, `src/auth.js`, `src/router.js`, `styles.css`. Vite на хосте: `cd frontend && npm run dev`.

## Database

`database/migrations/`, factories. Тестовая DB: `testing` (compose init script).

## Тесты

`tests/Feature/`: Authentication, Chat, Copilot, ContextSummary, RagSearch, RetrievalTools, StorytellerIntent. `UserFactory::storyteller()`, password `password`. Ollama: `Http::fake`/`ChatProvider` fake. RAG: `stub` в `phpunit.xml`.

## Out of scope (до этапа 4)

Таблицы `npcs`/`events`/`relationships`, `world/`, streaming, `laravel/ai`. См. `docs/Project/Roadmap.md`.

При изменении структуры каталогов — обновить `docs/Meta/Structure.md`.
